/**
 * @file groups.dox
 * @brief Doxygen module and architecture hierarchy definition for Corium.
 */

/**
 * @defgroup core Corium Core Engine
 * @brief Compile-time CRTP Application, Lock-Free Runtime, and Event Engine.
 * @details
 * The core engine coordinates all event processing with zero heap allocations,
 * zero virtual method tables, and zero RTTI.
 *
 * Key components:
 * - corium::Application: CRTP base class for domain logic.
 * - corium::BasicRuntime: Deterministic lifecycle and event pump coordinator.
 * - corium::BasicEventBus: Multi-producer single-consumer lock-free event bus.
 * - corium::BasicEventSink / corium::EventSinkT: Non-allocating type-erased fat pointer for thread-safe posting.
 * - corium::BasicServiceRegistry: Fixed-capacity background service container.
 * - corium::Service / corium::BackgroundService: Managed worker threads using std::jthread.
 * - corium::ServiceContext: Thread-safe runtime injection context for services.
 * - corium::RuntimeBuilder: Fluent compile-time builder for custom policy runtimes.
 */

/**
 * @defgroup embedded Embedded & Hardware ISR
 * @brief Bare-metal interrupt handlers, FreeRTOS integration, and hardware critical sections.
 * @details
 * Designed specifically for microcontrollers (ARM Cortex-M, ESP32, STM32, RP2040)
 * and real-time operating systems.
 *
 * Key components:
 * - corium::embedded::IsrEventSink: Safe non-blocking event posting from hardware ISRs.
 * - corium::embedded::FreeRtosIsrSink: FreeRTOS ISR sink managing task unblocking and context switching.
 * - corium::embedded::InterruptLock: Zero-overhead RAII critical section masking across ARM, ESP32, and host.
 */

/**
 * @defgroup timers Timers & Clocks
 * @brief Zero-heap timer scheduler and customizable hardware clock policies.
 * @details
 * Key components:
 * - corium::TimerScheduler: Fixed-capacity static array scheduler for delayed and periodic events.
 * - corium::ChronoClockPolicy: Standard std::chrono::steady_clock provider.
 * - corium::ManualClockPolicy: Deterministic simulated time for unit testing.
 * - corium::MicrosecondTickClockPolicy / corium::MillisecondTickClockPolicy: Hardware timer tick providers.
 * - corium::EspTimerClockPolicy: ESP32 hardware 64-bit microsecond timer.
 * - corium::FreeRtosClockPolicy: FreeRTOS tick counter provider.
 */

/**
 * @defgroup policies Policies & Storage
 * @brief Compile-time strategy policies for queues, signals, overflow, and storage.
 * @details
 * Key components:
 * - corium::BoundedMpscQueuePolicy: Dmitry Vyukov's lock-free MPSC ring buffer algorithm.
 * - corium::PriorityMpscQueuePolicy: Multi-tier priority queueing (High, Normal, Low).
 * - corium::FixedStoragePolicy: FastDelegate SBO inline size and handler capacity.
 * - corium::DropNewestOverflowPolicy / corium::DropOldestOverflowPolicy / corium::AuditOverflowPolicy / corium::PanicOverflowPolicy: Queue saturation policies.
 * - corium::NoSignalPolicy / corium::ConditionVariableSignalPolicy: Thread wake-up strategies.
 */

/**
 * @defgroup safety Safety & Supervision
 * @brief Automotive & aerospace safety supervisors, watchdogs, and fault isolation.
 * @details
 * Key components:
 * - corium::safety::WatchdogSupervisor: Multi-subsystem SLA monitor controlling hardware watchdog refresh.
 * - corium::safety::WatchdogService: Autonomous background watchdog supervisor thread.
 * - corium::safety::HeartbeatMonitor: Lock-free per-service heartbeat deadline tracking.
 * - corium::safety::CircuitBreaker: Lock-free state machine for fault detection and graceful degradation.
 * - corium::safety::PanicHandler: Global critical fault assertion and shutdown hook.
 */

/**
 * @defgroup profiler Telemetry & Profiler
 * @brief Real-time latency tracking and circular in-memory flight recording.
 * @details
 * Key components:
 * - corium::profiler::FlightRecorder: Circular telemetry buffer capturing timestamps with zero heap allocation.
 * - corium::profiler::LatencyTracker: Real-time per-event latency statistics (min, max, average) with runtime enable/disable.
 * - corium::profiler::FlightRecorderProfiler: Combined flight recorder and latency tracking policy.
 * - corium::profiler::exportChromeTracingJson(): Google Chrome Tracing and Perfetto JSON visualizer exporter.
 */

/**
 * @defgroup ipc Inter-Process Communication (IPC)
 * @brief High-speed zero-copy shared memory and UNIX domain socket channels.
 * @details
 * Key components:
 * - corium::ipc::IpcChannel: Zero-copy POSIX Shared Memory typed event exchange.
 * - corium::ipc::UdsChannel: UNIX Domain Datagram Socket inter-process event transmission.
 * - corium::ipc::PlatformChannel: Cross-platform portable datagram channel alias.
 * - corium::ipc::SharedMemory: RAII wrapper for POSIX shm / Windows file mapping.
 * - corium::ipc::ShmMpscQueue: Multi-producer single-consumer ring buffer in shared memory.
 */

/**
 * @defgroup wire Binary Wire Protocol
 * @brief CRC-16 validated binary packet framing and serialization over UART/CAN/TCP.
 * @details
 * Key components:
 * - corium::wire::WireHeader: Packed protocol header with magic, schema version, type index, flags, and CRC.
 * - corium::wire::WirePacket: Fixed-size binary frame with header, payload, and CRC-16 checksum.
 * - corium::wire::WireSerializer: Type-safe serialization and direct event sink deserialization with version validation.
 */

/**
 * @defgroup fsm Finite State Machine (FSM)
 * @brief Compile-time transition tables with guard conditions and entry/exit actions.
 * @details
 * Key components:
 * - corium::fsm::StateMachine: Zero-heap variant-based active state machine.
 * - corium::fsm::Transition: Declarative state transition rule with guards and actions.
 * - corium::fsm::InternalTransition: In-place internal transition without onExit/onEnter overhead.
 * - corium::fsm::ActionList: Sequential composite action runner.
 * - corium::fsm::ShallowHistory: Pseudostate remembering previous state in composite groups.
 * - corium::fsm::TransitionTable: Typelist of valid state transitions.
 */

/**
 * @defgroup async C++20 Coroutines
 * @brief Lightweight non-blocking async tasks with zero-heap resumption chaining.
 * @details
 * Key components:
 * - corium::async::Task: C++20 lazy awaitable coroutine task.
 * - corium::async::CancellationToken: Lock-free atomic cancellation token with whenCancelled() awaiter.
 * - corium::async::whenAll(): Non-blocking parallel task combinator (value & void).
 * - corium::async::whenAny(): Fastest-wins non-blocking task combinator.
 * - corium::async::Generator: Pull-based zero-heap lazy sequence generator.
 * - corium::async::delay() / corium::async::yield(): Non-blocking asynchronous awaitables.
 */

/**
 * @defgroup logging Zero-Heap Logging
 * @brief High-throughput structured logging sinks with severity filtering.
 * @details
 * Key components:
 * - corium::logging::LoggerT: Static logger wrapper with compile-time formatting.
 * - corium::logging::LogEventT: Zero-heap fixed-buffer log record.
 * - corium::logging::sinks::ConsoleLogSink: ANSI-color enabled console sink.
 * - corium::logging::sinks::FileLogSink: Low-overhead synchronous file sink.
 * - corium::logging::sinks::JsonLogSink: Structured JSON Lines (NDJSON) telemetry sink.
 * - corium::logging::sinks::NullLogSink: Zero-overhead compile-time disabled sink.
 * - corium::logging::LogBackgroundService: Async background disk flush worker.
 */
